More of the native instruction forms OoT's world uses, mostly as Lichii lowers them: ISETP.EX with a
predicate to combine, bindless TEX in its array/LOD/offset/depth forms, FSWZADD's whole swizzle, TXQ
with a second destination, the remaining S2R values, RED with type and offset, FRND from a constant
buffer, LDC.IS, USHF by a register, ATOMS.POPC, SHF.HI. ALD and AST take part in register shadowing.
A program whose warp cancellations the proofs do not cover is lowered again without BSSY, BSYNC and
BREAK, since threads run independently here. Offline on 200 dumped programs: 2 lowered before, 194
now. EDEN_MESH_DRAW_NO_PIPELINE counts task/mesh draws lost to a rejected stage and EDEN_AUDIO_VOICE
counts voices that were not fed. Bumps the translator salt.

